### Arquivo de testes manuais da API.
### No VS Code, instale a extensao "REST Client" e clique em "Send Request"
### acima de cada bloco. Os blocos sao separados por "###".

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Health check (rota publica)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Cadastro -> deve retornar 400 (senha fraca, sem maiuscula e curta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Helena",
  "email": "helena.marino@exemplo.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### 3. Cadastro -> deve retornar 400 (e-mail em formato invalido)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Helena Marino",
  "email": "nao-e-um-email",
  "password": "EternalFlame7"
}

### 4. Cadastro -> deve retornar 400 (campo extra barrado pelo .strict())
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Helena Marino",
  "email": "hacker@teste.com",
  "password": "EternalFlame7",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 5. Cadastro valido -> 201 Created (note o e-mail com maiusculas)
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Helena Marino",
  "email": "helena.marino@exemplo.com",
  "password": "EternalFlame7",
  "confirmPassword": "EternalFlame7"
}

### 6. Mesmo e-mail em minusculas -> 409 Conflict
### (indice unico sobre lower(email) + SQLSTATE 23505)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outra Pessoa",
  "email": "helena.marino@exemplo.com",
  "password": "EternalFlame7"
}

### 7. Login com senha errada -> 401 ("E-mail ou senha inválidos.")
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "helena.marino@exemplo.com",
  "password": "SenhaErrada7"
}

### 8. Login com e-mail inexistente -> 401 com a MESMA mensagem do item 7
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "naoexiste@teste.com",
  "password": "EternalFlame7"
}

### 9. Login valido -> 200 e devolve o accessToken
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "helena.marino@exemplo.com",
  "password": "EternalFlame7"
}

### 10. Area restrita SEM token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard

### 11. Area restrita com token FALSIFICADO -> 401 (assinatura invalida)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIn0.assinatura_falsa

### 12. Area restrita COM token valido -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 13. Perfil do usuario autenticado -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 14. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 15. Rota inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/rota-que-nao-existe
